  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEESAC Fight against illegal SALW-UNDP-IRH-00128185</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to strengthen strategic and operational capacity of the WB authorities to conduct firearms investigations as well as exchange information within the region and with the EU on illegal possession, misuse and trafficking of SALW and their ammo.The new phase of the SEESAC project will build upon the basis of the achievements under Decision 2013/730/CFSP and in complementarity with Decision (CFSP) 2016/2356.It will focus on three main areas, maintaining the holistic approach to tackling</narrative>
  </description>
