     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the establishment of the network of the FFPs and developing its capacities, SEESAC organized two annual regional workshops for FFPs from the Western Balkans in the Hague and Belgrade. Furthermore, SEESAC organized several trainings for providing technical assistance and strengthening capacities of FFPs such as the Social Media Intelligence training, the Cyber Patrolling Workshop, the Regional Meeting on Knowledge and the Best Practice Exchange in the Field of Ballistic Examination and Ballistic Intelligence and Workshop on Intelligence Collection of the Firearms Focal Points in support of EMPACT Joint Action Days. Additionally, in the scope of supporting further operationalization of FFPs, SEESAC organized workshops for developing Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) for FFPs in North Macedonia, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Serbia, Montenegro and Albania.</narrative>
